  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">金屬束帶</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 擴展了 Minecraft 的束帶升級體系，提供由越來越珍貴的材料製成、容量更大的束帶階級。你可以將束帶升級為皮革、銅、鐵、金、鑽石和獄髓版本，讓你在冒險途中攜帶更多物品。📦</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更大的束帶只是故事的一部分。此模組還強化了束帶的使用方式，讓物品欄管理更快速且直覺。你可以瀏覽存放的物品、精準選擇你想要的物品，並無需不斷打開專用介面即可放入或取出物品。🎯</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">本模組基於 Minecraft 現代的束帶機制，保留了熟悉的原版體驗，同時加入更強大的導航功能、更佳的視覺效果，以及更多的物品欄互動方式。無論是整理建築材料、攜帶戰利品，還是為長途旅行做準備，更大的束帶都能讓使用變得更加實用。✨</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">六種新束帶階級：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可製作皮革、銅、鐵、金、鑽石和獄髓束帶，儲存容量逐步提升。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可升級的進程：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">直接將現有束帶升級到下一階級，無需從頭製作全新束帶。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">查看所有存放物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">直接在束帶工具提示中顯示所有內容，讓管理大型束帶更加方便。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">選擇任何存放物品：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">使用滾輪或鍵盤方向鍵來精準選擇你想要互動的存放物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📝 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">選定物品詳情：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">瀏覽束帶內容時，可即時查看目前選定物品的資訊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">↔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">快速物品轉移：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">透過直覺的物品欄互動，快速放入和取出物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖱️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">跨多個格子拖曳：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">在物品欄格子間點擊並拖曳，可大量放入或取出物品，大幅加速物品欄管理。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎚️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">精確物品移動：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">按住 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ctrl</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Mac 為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Command</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）可移動單個物品而非整組，精確控制轉移數量。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💡 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">智慧相容性指示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">視覺提示會顯示手持物品是否能放入束帶，以及束帶內是否已有相同物品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📊 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">改進的填充指示器：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">強化後的束帶容量指示器，讓你一眼掌握儲存使用情況。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">高度可自訂：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">可自訂儲存容量、互動方式、操作設定、工具提示行為及視覺功能，以符合你偏好的遊玩風格。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">用戶端與伺服器端皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">如果模組支援，可在遊戲內直接透過模組選單進行設定（Fabric 需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 製作）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器手動設定，所有設定檔均位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，檔案名稱分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，視設定類型而定。並非所有類型都會存在於模組中，甚至可能完全沒有設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/overflowing-bars\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/overflowingbars/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mob-lassos\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/moblassos/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/magnum-torch\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/magnumtorch/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
